const i="data:image/svg+xml;base64,",n={title:"NEON UJI – Case Study UX & Product Design",title_en:"NEON UJI – UX Case Study & Product Design",slug:"neon-uji",isActive:!0,statusBadge:"Case Study",statusBadge_en:"Case Study",roles:["Product Designer","UX Designer"],roles_en:["Product Designer","UX Designer"],description:"Perancangan pengalaman produk digital end-to-end untuk NEON UJI, mencakup pemecahan masalah UX, task flow, UI high-fidelity, design system, dan Design QA.",description_en:"End-to-end digital product design for NEON UJI, covering UX problem solving, task flows, high-fidelity UI, design system standardization, and Design QA.",longDescription:"Proyek perancangan produk digital berskala produksi untuk platform edukasi NEON UJI di PT Vortex Buana Edumedia. Bekerja secara terstruktur mulai dari riset kebutuhan, penentuan problem framing (How Might We, Crazy 8s, matriks prioritas), penyusunan task flows dan arsitektur informasi, hingga eksekusi high-fidelity design di Figma. Bertanggung jawab penuh menyusun design handoff yang presisi untuk developer serta memimpin Design QA lintas perangkat guna memastikan konsistensi tipografi, spacing, interaction state, responsivitas, dan aksesibilitas.",longDescription_en:"A production-grade digital product design initiative for the NEON UJI edtech platform at PT Vortex Buana Edumedia. Guided by a structured end-to-end design methodology: problem framing (HMW, Crazy 8s, prioritization matrices), task flows and information architecture, through to high-fidelity UI creation in Figma. Accountable for comprehensive developer design handoffs and cross-device Design QA to validate typography, spacing, interaction states, responsive behavior, and accessibility.",imageSrc:i,techTags:["UI/UX Design","Product Design","Design System","Figma","Task Flow"],timeline:"Jul 2026 – Okt 2026",timeline_en:"Jul 2026 – Oct 2026",platform:"Web & Mobile Application",platform_en:"Web & Mobile Application",context:"PT Vortex Buana Edumedia · Apprenticeship",context_en:"PT Vortex Buana Edumedia · Apprenticeship",projectUrl:""},t="data:image/svg+xml;base64,",s={title:"NEON Design System – Standarisasi Komponen & Token",title_en:"NEON Design System – Component Library & Design Tokens",slug:"neon-design-system",isActive:!0,statusBadge:"Design System",statusBadge_en:"Design System",roles:["Design System Lead","UI Designer"],roles_en:["Design System Lead","UI Designer"],description:"Sistem desain terpadu untuk platform NEON UJI: standarisasi token warna, skala tipografi, library komponen interaktif, dokumentasi spesifikasi, dan panduan developer handoff.",description_en:"A unified design system for the NEON UJI platform: design tokens, typography hierarchy, reusable interactive component library, documentation, and handoff guidelines.",longDescription:"NEON Design System dibangun untuk memastikan konsistensi visual, efisiensi kerja tim lintas disiplin, dan kecepatan implementasi frontend pada produk NEON UJI (PT Vortex Buana Edumedia). Mencakup arsitektur token (warna netral dan semantik, spasi 4px-grid, radius, elevasi bayangan), komponen atomik hingga organisme (Buttons, Input Fields, Badges, Modals, Data Tables), serta aturan accessibility (kontras rasio WCAG). Dilengkapi dokumentasi spesifikasi interaksi, states (default, hover, focus, disabled, error), dan checklist Design QA.",longDescription_en:"NEON Design System was architected to guarantee visual consistency, cross-functional velocity, and streamlined frontend delivery across the NEON UJI ecosystem at PT Vortex Buana Edumedia. Encompasses design token architecture (semantic color systems, 4px grid spacing, radius scales, surface elevations), atomic-to-organism components (Buttons, Form Controls, Overlays, Navigation Rails), alongside WCAG accessibility compliance and comprehensive interaction state guidelines.",imageSrc:t,techTags:["Design System","Figma","UI Components","Design Tokens","Design QA"],timeline:"Jul 2026 – Okt 2026",timeline_en:"Jul 2026 – Oct 2026",platform:"Cross-Platform System (Web & Mobile)",platform_en:"Cross-Platform System (Web & Mobile)",context:"PT Vortex Buana Edumedia · Apprenticeship",context_en:"PT Vortex Buana Edumedia · Apprenticeship",projectUrl:""},a="/assets/VitaCal-BjXXcBUM.webp",o={title:"Vitacal App – Aplikasi Kesehatan (Beta Test)",title_en:"Vitacal App – Health & Nutrition Tracker (Beta Test)",slug:"vitacal-app-aplikasi-kesehatan",statusBadge:"Beta Test",statusBadge_en:"Beta Test",roles:["UI/UX Designer","Frontend Developer","Backend Developer"],roles_en:["UI/UX Designer","Frontend Developer","Backend Developer"],isActive:!0,gallery:[a,a,a],description:"Aplikasi mobile penghitung kalori dan analisis nutrisi personal menggunakan algoritma Mifflin-St Jeor, terintegrasi Open Food Facts API dan dataset Kaggle.",description_en:"A mobile app for daily calorie calculation and personal nutritional analysis using the Mifflin-St Jeor algorithm, integrated with Open Food Facts API and Kaggle datasets.",longDescription:"Vitacal App adalah aplikasi mobile kesehatan yang membantu pengguna memahami kebutuhan kalori harian mereka secara lebih akurat dan personal. Aplikasi ini menggunakan algoritma Mifflin-St Jeor untuk menghitung BMR, BMI, serta memberikan rekomendasi dan analisis kalori berdasarkan data pribadi pengguna. Proyek ini dikembangkan mulai dari riset UI/UX di Figma, hingga implementasi Frontend menggunakan Flutter dan Backend dengan Flask serta PostgreSQL. Untuk memperkaya fungsionalitas, data pencarian makanan diambil dari dataset publik Kaggle, dan fitur pemindai barcode makanan diintegrasikan langsung dengan Open Food Facts API. Sistem autentikasi menggunakan OTP via Fonnte API untuk akses yang cepat. Fokus utama proyek ini adalah menghadirkan alat pemantau nutrisi yang kompleks secara data teknis, namun tetap memiliki antarmuka yang sangat sederhana digunakan.",imageSrc:a,techTags:["Flutter","Flask","PostgreSQL","Mifflin Algorithm","Open Food Facts API","Kaggle Dataset","Fonnte API","Figma"],timeline:"2025 - 2026",platform:"Mobile Application",platform_en:"Mobile Application",context:"Final Academic Project / Tugas Akhir",context_en:"Final Academic Project / Graduation Thesis",theChallenge:"Memahami asupan kalori harian dan menjaga berat badan ideal merupakan tantangan bagi banyak orang. Sayangnya, banyak aplikasi pencatat kalori di pasaran memiliki antarmuka yang terlalu rumit dan database makanan yang terbatas. Pengguna sering kali merasa kesulitan dan kehilangan motivasi saat harus memasukkan data makanan kemasan yang mereka konsumsi sehari-hari secara manual.",theChallenge_en:"Understanding daily calorie intake and maintaining an ideal weight is a challenge for many. Unfortunately, many calorie tracking apps on the market have interfaces that are too complex and food databases that are too limited. Users often struggle and lose motivation when they have to manually log packaged foods they consume daily.",theSolution:"Pendekatan Vitacal App berfokus pada personalisasi pengguna dan kemudahan input data. Mengandalkan algoritma <strong>Mifflin-St Jeor</strong> yang teruji klinis, aplikasi membagi sistem menjadi Frontend Flutter yang responsif dan Backend Flask. Untuk mengatasi hambatan pencatatan, sistem menarik data dari dataset publik Kaggle untuk pencarian makanan lokal, dan mengintegrasikan Open Food Facts API agar pengguna cukup melakukan scan barcode pada makanan kemasan tanpa harus mengetik manual.",theSolution_en:"The Vitacal App approach focuses on user personalization and ease of data entry. Relying on the clinically proven <strong>Mifflin-St Jeor</strong> algorithm, the app splits the system into a responsive Flutter frontend and a Flask backend. To address logging friction, the system pulls data from a public Kaggle dataset for local food searches, and integrates the Open Food Facts API so users can simply scan barcodes on packaged foods instead of typing manually.",keyFeatures:[{title:"Personalisasi & Analisis Kalori",desc:"Menghitung batas kalori harian, BMI, dan analisis riwayat berat badan secara personal dan presisi menggunakan algoritma Mifflin."},{title:"Smart Barcode Scanner",desc:"Integrasi dengan Open Food Facts API untuk mengenali dan melacak nutrisi makanan kemasan secara instan hanya dengan memindai barcode."},{title:"Pencarian Makanan Komprehensif",desc:"Database pencarian makanan yang kaya dan akurat, diolah langsung dari dataset nutrisi publik Kaggle."},{title:"Otentikasi OTP WhatsApp",desc:"Sistem login dan registrasi yang mulus, aman, dan tanpa password menggunakan nomor WhatsApp melalui integrasi Fonnte API."}],keyFeatures_en:[{title:"Personalization & Calorie Analysis",desc:"Calculates daily calorie limits, BMI, and analyzes weight history precisely using the Mifflin algorithm."},{title:"Smart Barcode Scanner",desc:"Integration with the Open Food Facts API to instantly identify and track packaged food nutrition by scanning barcodes."},{title:"Comprehensive Food Search",desc:"Rich and accurate food search database, processed directly from Kaggle public nutrition datasets."},{title:"WhatsApp OTP Authentication",desc:"Seamless, secure, passwordless registration and login using WhatsApp numbers integrated via Fonnte API."}],theImpact:"Aplikasi ini berhasil menghadirkan solusi pemantauan gizi yang sangat praktis. Integrasi API pihak ketiga (Kaggle & Open Food Facts) secara signifikan memangkas waktu proses logging makanan bagi pengguna, menjadikan aplikasi ini tidak sekadar prototipe teoretis, melainkan produk fungsional yang siap memecahkan masalah diet di dunia nyata.",theImpact_en:"This application successfully delivers a highly practical nutritional monitoring solution. Third-party API integrations (Kaggle & Open Food Facts) significantly reduced food logging time for users, making the app not just a theoretical prototype, but a functional product ready to solve real-world dietary challenges.",projectUrl:"https://github.com/ariyoaziz/vitacal_app"},r="/assets/frameflow-D2wu_GtD.png",l={title:"FrameFlow – Solusi Proofing Foto Modern (Beta Test)",title_en:"FrameFlow – Modern Photo Proofing Solution (Beta Test)",slug:"frameflow",statusBadge:"Beta Test",statusBadge_en:"Beta Test",isActive:!0,roles:["UI/UX Designer","Frontend Developer"],roles_en:["UI/UX Designer","Frontend Developer"],description:"Platform delivery foto instan yang mengintegrasikan Google Drive dan WhatsApp untuk mempermudah klien memilih foto favorit tanpa ribet.",description_en:"An instant photo delivery platform integrating Google Drive and WhatsApp to simplify the photo selection process for clients.",longDescription:"FrameFlow adalah solusi proofing foto modern yang dirancang khusus untuk fotografer (Wedding, Portrait, Event, Commercial). Aplikasi ini mempercepat proses pengiriman foto ke klien. Cukup hubungkan Google Drive, buat galeri dalam hitungan detik, dan biarkan klien memilih foto favorit mereka secara interaktif. Hasil pilihan klien akan otomatis dikirimkan ke WhatsApp Anda, menghilangkan keribetan dan miskomunikasi dalam proses seleksi foto. Proyek ini masih dalam tahap beta test.",longDescription_en:"FrameFlow is a modern photo proofing solution designed specifically for photographers (Wedding, Portrait, Event, Commercial). This app speeds up the photo delivery process to clients. Simply connect Google Drive, create a gallery in seconds, and let clients choose their favorite photos interactively. The client's selections will automatically be sent to your WhatsApp, eliminating hassle and miscommunication in the photo selection process. This project is currently in the beta test stage.",imageSrc:r,techTags:["Frontend","Web App","UI/UX Design","Beta Test"],timeline:"2025",timeline_en:"2025",platform:"Web Application",platform_en:"Web Application",context:"Personal Project / Eksplorasi Frontend",context_en:"Personal Project / Frontend Exploration",projectUrl:"https://frameflow-navy.vercel.app/"},g="data:image/svg+xml;base64,",m={title:"Berworkshed – Digital Product & Creative Workshop",title_en:"Berworkshed – Digital Product & Creative Workshop",slug:"berworkshed",isActive:!0,isBuilding:!0,statusBadge:"Building",statusBadge_en:"Building",roles:["Founder","Product Designer","Developer"],roles_en:["Founder","Product Designer","Developer"],description:"Inisiatif studio mandiri dan bengkel kerja kreatif yang sedang dibangun untuk merancang solusi digital, produk web interaktif, dan eksplorasi desain terapan.",description_en:"An independent studio initiative and creative workshop currently being built to craft digital solutions, interactive web products, and applied design explorations.",longDescription:"Berworkshed adalah inisiatif studio mandiri dan wadah eksplorasi kreatif yang berfokus pada desain produk digital, rekayasa frontend modern, dan perancangan pengalaman pengguna yang berkarakter. Proyek ini dibangun dari nol sebagai laboratorium kerja untuk melahirkan produk-produk mandiri yang menyelesaikan kebutuhan nyata, mulai dari tool produktivitas, antarmuka web interaktif, hingga visual branding. Saat ini Berworkshed sedang dalam tahap pembangunan fondasi, standarisasi sistem komponen, dan pengembangan portofolio produk perdana.",longDescription_en:"Berworkshed is an independent studio initiative and creative workshop space focusing on digital product design, modern frontend engineering, and distinctive user experience craftsmanship. Built from the ground up as a working laboratory, it aims to create standalone products that solve real user needs—spanning productivity tools, interactive web interfaces, and visual branding. Currently in active development, focusing on component system standardization and inaugural product builds.",imageSrc:g,techTags:["Building","Product Design","Creative Studio","Frontend","UI/UX Design"],timeline:"2026 – Sekarang",timeline_en:"2026 – Present",platform:"Digital Studio / Lab",platform_en:"Digital Studio / Lab",context:"Independent Venture / Building in Public",context_en:"Independent Venture / Building in Public",projectUrl:""},e="/assets/CV-Builder-WehR7VeG.png",d={title:"CV Builder",title_en:"CV Builder",slug:"cv-builder",statusBadge:"Web App",statusBadge_en:"Web App",roles:["Product Designer","Frontend Developer"],roles_en:["Product Designer","Frontend Developer"],isActive:!0,description:"CV Builder adalah aplikasi web client-side untuk membuat CV profesional yang terstruktur, ramah ATS, responsif, dan siap dicetak atau disimpan sebagai PDF langsung dari browser.",description_en:"CV Builder is a client-side web application for creating structured, ATS-friendly, responsive CVs that can be printed or saved as PDF directly from the browser.",longDescription:"CV Builder dirancang untuk membantu pengguna membuat CV profesional dengan proses yang cepat, terstruktur, dan tetap fleksibel. Aplikasi ini berjalan sepenuhnya di sisi client, sehingga pengguna dapat mengedit CV tanpa akun dan tanpa database. Editor CV menggunakan section yang terstruktur, menyediakan template Modern, Minimal, dan Classic, serta menampilkan preview real-time dengan format kertas A4. CV dapat langsung dicetak atau disimpan sebagai PDF melalui fitur bawaan browser. Pengguna juga dapat mengimpor dan mengekspor data CV dalam format JSON agar data mudah dipindahkan dan dicadangkan. Dukungan bahasa Indonesia dan Inggris, tampilan yang responsif untuk desktop, tablet, dan mobile, security headers, optimasi static assets, serta metadata Open Graph melengkapi pengalaman aplikasi. Untuk membantu penulisan, aplikasi menyediakan prompt AI eksternal yang dapat digunakan secara manual untuk membuat atau memperbaiki isi CV, kemudian hasil JSON-nya dapat diimpor kembali ke aplikasi. Seluruh data utama disimpan di browser menggunakan localStorage dan tidak dikirim ke server secara otomatis. Source code dikembangkan di repository privat CV-Builder-Raw, disanitasi melalui GitHub Actions ke repository publik CV-Builder, lalu dideploy sebagai static export Next.js dengan output folder out menggunakan Cloudflare Workers Static Assets ke website production cv-builder.weareaap.workers.dev.",longDescription_en:"CV Builder is designed to help users create professional CVs through a fast, structured, and flexible workflow. The application runs entirely on the client side, allowing users to edit their CV without an account or database. Its structured editor includes Modern, Minimal, and Classic templates, along with a real-time A4 paper preview. CVs can be printed or saved as PDF directly through the browser. Users can also import and export CV data as JSON for easy transfer and backup. Indonesian and English language support, responsive layouts for desktop, tablet, and mobile, security headers, static asset optimization, and Open Graph metadata complete the experience. For writing assistance, the app provides external AI prompts that can be used manually to create or improve CV content, after which the resulting JSON can be imported back into the application. All primary data is stored in the browser using localStorage and is not sent to a server automatically. Source code is developed in the private CV-Builder-Raw repository, sanitized through GitHub Actions into the public CV-Builder repository, then deployed as a Next.js static export with the out output folder using Cloudflare Workers Static Assets at cv-builder.weareaap.workers.dev.",keyFeatures:[{title:"Editor CV Terstruktur",desc:"Menyusun isi CV melalui section yang jelas agar informasi mudah dikelola dan tetap ramah ATS."},{title:"Tiga Template Visual",desc:"Pilih template Modern, Minimal, atau Classic sesuai kebutuhan dan karakter profesional."},{title:"Preview A4 dan PDF",desc:"Melihat perubahan secara real-time dalam format A4, lalu mencetak atau menyimpan CV sebagai PDF langsung dari browser."},{title:"Import dan Export JSON",desc:"Memindahkan, mencadangkan, dan memulihkan data CV menggunakan format JSON."},{title:"Penyimpanan Lokal",desc:"Data utama disimpan di localStorage tanpa akun dan tanpa database, sehingga tetap berada di browser pengguna."},{title:"Prompt AI Eksternal",desc:"Membantu membuat atau memperbaiki isi CV melalui layanan AI eksternal secara manual, kemudian mengimpor hasil JSON kembali ke aplikasi."},{title:"Bilingual dan Responsif",desc:"Mendukung bahasa Indonesia dan Inggris serta nyaman digunakan di desktop, tablet, dan mobile."},{title:"Static Deployment",desc:"Dibangun sebagai static export Next.js dengan output out dan dideploy melalui Cloudflare Workers Static Assets."}],keyFeatures_en:[{title:"Structured CV Editor",desc:"Organize CV content into clear sections so information stays easy to manage and ATS-friendly."},{title:"Three Visual Templates",desc:"Choose Modern, Minimal, or Classic templates based on your needs and professional style."},{title:"A4 Preview and PDF",desc:"See changes in real time on an A4 layout, then print or save the CV as PDF directly from the browser."},{title:"JSON Import and Export",desc:"Transfer, back up, and restore CV data using the JSON format."},{title:"Local Storage",desc:"Primary data is stored in localStorage without accounts or a database, keeping it in the user's browser."},{title:"External AI Prompts",desc:"Create or improve CV content through an external AI service manually, then import the resulting JSON back into the app."},{title:"Bilingual and Responsive",desc:"Supports Indonesian and English and works comfortably on desktop, tablet, and mobile."},{title:"Static Deployment",desc:"Built as a Next.js static export with an out output folder and deployed through Cloudflare Workers Static Assets."}],imageSrc:e,gallery:[e],techTags:["Frontend","Next.js","React","TypeScript","Tailwind CSS","Radix UI","Zustand","React Hook Form","Zod","Lucide React","Sonner","date-fns","GitHub Actions","Cloudflare Workers","Static Export"],timeline:"2026",timeline_en:"2026",platform:"Web Application",platform_en:"Web Application",context:"Personal Product / Portfolio Project",context_en:"Personal Product / Portfolio Project",projectUrl:"https://cv-builder.weareaap.workers.dev"},I="/assets/linkaja-BOdbDh29.webp",c={title:"UI/UX Redesign – Aplikasi LinkAja (Halaman Beranda)",title_en:"UI/UX Redesign – LinkAja App (Homepage)",slug:"ui-ux-redesign-aplikasi-linkaja-halaman-beranda",statusBadge:"Case Study",statusBadge_en:"Case Study",isActive:!1,roles:["UI/UX Designer"],roles_en:["UI/UX Designer"],description:"Redesain halaman beranda aplikasi LinkAja dengan fokus pada penyederhanaan antarmuka dan peningkatan navigasi pengguna.",description_en:"Redesign of the LinkAja app homepage focusing on interface simplification, logical feature grouping, and improved visual accessibility. Features a modern and clean style for better mobile navigation.",imageSrc:I,techTags:["UI/UX Design","Figma","Redesign","Mobile App"],timeline:"Dikerjakan waktu kuliah",timeline_en:"Developed during college",platform:"Design Concept / Figma",platform_en:"Design Concept / Figma",context:"Studi Kasus UI/UX",context_en:"UI/UX Case Study",projectUrl:"https://www.figma.com/proto/IDGtCHDIcpBGVSCdmmEieC/Desain-Ulang-APP-LInkAja?page-id=5%3A57&node-id=5-60&p=f&viewport=293%2C-18%2C1.28&t=tBMct1pVLikWEzHC-1&scaling=scale-down&content-scaling=fixed",theChallenge:"Aplikasi keuangan digital seringkali dipenuhi dengan puluhan fitur dan ikon promosi di halaman berandanya, membuat pengguna baru merasa kebingungan (<em>cognitive overload</em>) saat mencoba mencari fitur utama seperti transfer atau pembayaran.",theChallenge_en:"Digital financial apps are often packed with dozens of features and promotional icons on their homepage, causing new users to experience cognitive overload when trying to find main functions like transfers or payments.",theSolution:"Melalui proses riset desain, saya merancang ulang halaman beranda LinkAja di Figma. Saya mengelompokkan ikon berdasarkan kategori prioritas, memperbesar elemen navigasi utama, serta memberikan ruang kosong (<em>white space</em>) yang cukup agar tampilan terasa lebih bersih, modern, dan minimalis.",theSolution_en:"Through a design research process, I redesigned the LinkAja homepage in Figma. I grouped icons based on priority categories, enlarged the main navigation elements, and provided sufficient white space so that the layout feels cleaner, more modern, and minimalist.",keyFeatures:[{title:"Simplified Navigation",desc:"Mengurangi kekacauan visual dengan memprioritaskan fungsi utama aplikasi."},{title:"Modern Aesthetics",desc:"Pendekatan warna dan tipografi baru yang lebih menyegarkan mata pengguna."}],keyFeatures_en:[{title:"Simplified Navigation",desc:"Reduces visual clutter by prioritizing the app's core functionalities."},{title:"Modern Aesthetics",desc:"A refreshing new color and typography approach that is easier on the user's eyes."}],theImpact:"Desain ulang ini menghasilkan prototipe visual yang jauh lebih intuitif. Studi kasus ini membuktikan bahwa penyederhanaan antarmuka dapat secara drastis meningkatkan kenyamanan pengguna tanpa harus menghilangkan fungsionalitas bisnis dari aplikasi itu sendiri.",theImpact_en:"This redesign resulted in a significantly more intuitive visual prototype. This case study demonstrates that simplifying the interface can drastically improve user comfort without eliminating the business functionalities of the app itself."},p="/assets/e-com-D4MADJYd.webp",u={title:"UI/UX Design – Website E-Commerce Alat Outdoor",title_en:"UI/UX Design – Outdoor Gear E-Commerce",slug:"ui-ux-design-website-e-commerce-alat-outdoor",statusBadge:"Case Study",statusBadge_en:"Case Study",isActive:!1,roles:["UI/UX Designer"],roles_en:["UI/UX Designer"],description:"Desain UI/UX untuk platform e-commerce perlengkapan outdoor dengan navigasi yang intuitif dan visual yang bersih.",description_en:"Interface design for an e-commerce platform selling outdoor gear such as tents, cooking equipment, and hiking clothes. Focuses on intuitive user experience.",imageSrc:p,techTags:["UI/UX Design","Figma","E-Commerce","Prototyping"],timeline:"Dikerjakan waktu kuliah",timeline_en:"Developed during college",platform:"Design Concept / Figma",platform_en:"Design Concept / Figma",context:"Latihan Eksplorasi Desain",context_en:"Design Exploration Practice",projectUrl:"https://www.figma.com/design/cQTRvW7zsCFRTWT30f5tHe/e-Com?node-id=0-1&t=kskOzYVPNCdrkweR-1",theChallenge:"Situs <em>e-commerce</em> seringkali penuh sesak dengan produk, filter, dan promosi yang membuat pengguna kebingungan mencari barang spesifik, terutama untuk produk <em>niche</em> seperti peralatan <em>outdoor</em> dan <em>hiking</em>.",theChallenge_en:"E-commerce websites are often cluttered with products, filters, and promotions that confuse users looking for specific items, especially for niche products like outdoor and hiking gear.",theSolution:"Saya memusatkan desain pada navigasi yang efisien (<em>frictionless navigation</em>). Proses penyaringan kategori (tenda, alat masak, pakaian) dibuat sangat menonjol. Saya menerapkan skema warna <em>earth-tone</em> yang selaras dengan tema alam bebas, serta memberikan ruang kosong yang luas (<em>clean UI</em>) di sekitar foto produk.",theSolution_en:"I focused the design on frictionless navigation. The category filtering process (tents, cooking gear, apparel) is highly emphasized. I applied an earth-toned color palette aligned with the outdoor theme, and provided ample white space around product photos for a clean UI.",keyFeatures:[{title:"Clean Layout",desc:"Fokus langsung pada produk berkualitas tinggi tanpa distraksi elemen berlebih."},{title:"Intuitive Filtering",desc:"Sistem filter dan pencarian yang disesuaikan dengan kebiasaan pendaki/petualang."}],keyFeatures_en:[{title:"Clean Layout",desc:"Direct focus on high-quality products without the distraction of excessive UI elements."},{title:"Intuitive Filtering",desc:"Filter and search systems customized to the habits of hikers/adventurers."}],theImpact:"Menghasilkan <em>mockup</em> UI beresolusi tinggi yang siap diserahkan (<em>hand-off</em>) kepada tim <em>frontend</em>. Desain ini membuktikan kemampuan saya merangkai antarmuka penjualan yang berorientasi pada konversi (<em>conversion-centric design</em>).",theImpact_en:"Delivered a high-fidelity UI mockup ready for hand-off to the frontend team. This design demonstrates my ability to create sales interfaces focused on conversion-centric design."},h="/assets/food-order-BvjOOP68.webp",k={title:"UI/UX Design – Order Food App",title_en:"UI/UX Design – Order Food App",slug:"ui-ux-design-order-food-app",statusBadge:"Case Study",statusBadge_en:"Case Study",isActive:!1,roles:["UI/UX Designer"],roles_en:["UI/UX Designer"],description:"Konsep desain aplikasi pemesanan makanan dengan tampilan modern dan alur pemesanan yang sederhana.",description_en:"Food ordering app design concept with a clean and modern approach. Provides an easily navigable user experience.",imageSrc:h,techTags:["UI/UX Design","Figma","Mobile App","Prototype"],timeline:"Dikerjakan waktu kuliah",timeline_en:"Developed during college",platform:"Design Concept / Figma",platform_en:"Design Concept / Figma",context:"Personal Portfolio Design",context_en:"Personal Portfolio Design",projectUrl:"https://www.behance.net/gallery/210655317/order-food",theChallenge:"Membuat aplikasi pengantaran makanan mengharuskan kita memikirkan bagaimana pengguna bisa menemukan makanan favorit, memasukkan ke keranjang, dan melakukan <em>checkout</em> dalam jumlah ketukan (<em>taps</em>) seminimal mungkin.",theChallenge_en:"Creating a food delivery app requires thinking about how users can find their favorite food, add it to the cart, and complete checkout in as few taps as possible.",theSolution:"Desain aplikasi ini memprioritaskan fotografi makanan (<em>food imagery</em>) yang besar untuk menggugah selera pengguna. Alur pemesanan dirancang secara linier (satu arah) agar tidak membingungkan, dari halaman beranda, rincian menu, modifikasi pesanan (<em>add-ons</em>), hingga layar <em>checkout</em> akhir.",theSolution_en:"The design of this application prioritizes large food imagery to stimulate the user's appetite. The order flow is designed linearly (one-way) to avoid confusion, navigating smoothly from the homepage, menu details, order customizations (add-ons), to the final checkout screen.",keyFeatures:[{title:"Appetizing Visuals",desc:"Penataan UI yang menonjolkan visual gambar menu dengan tata letak bergaya modern."},{title:"Linear Checkout Flow",desc:"Alur pembelian yang sangat ringkas untuk mempercepat proses konversi pesanan."}],keyFeatures_en:[{title:"Appetizing Visuals",desc:"UI layout highlighting menu imagery with modern layout styles."},{title:"Linear Checkout Flow",desc:"A highly simplified buying flow to speed up the order conversion process."}],theImpact:"Konsep desain ini telah dipublikasikan di Behance dan mendapatkan apresiasi positif atas pendekatan minimalisnya yang tetap mempertahankan fungsionalitas utama aplikasi pesan antar.",theImpact_en:"This design concept was published on Behance and received positive feedback for its minimalist approach while retaining the core features of a food delivery application."},b="/assets/kopi-C3v7gSjj.webp",Z={title:"UI/UX Design – Coffee App",title_en:"UI/UX Design – Coffee App",slug:"ui-ux-design-coffee-app",statusBadge:"Case Study",statusBadge_en:"Case Study",isActive:!1,roles:["UI/UX Designer"],roles_en:["UI/UX Designer"],description:"Desain antarmuka aplikasi pemesanan kopi dengan visual elegan dan alur pengguna yang sederhana.",description_en:"An elegant and modern coffee ordering app interface design, emphasizing user comfort. Designed using Figma.",imageSrc:b,techTags:["UI/UX Design","Figma","Mobile App","Product Design"],timeline:"Dikerjakan waktu kuliah",timeline_en:"Developed during college",platform:"Design Concept / Figma",platform_en:"Design Concept / Figma",context:"Personal Portfolio Design",context_en:"Personal Portfolio Design",projectUrl:"https://www.behance.net/gallery/210655381/coffee",theChallenge:"Aplikasi <em>coffee shop</em> membutuhkan sentuhan personalisasi yang kuat (seperti mengatur ukuran gelas, kadar gula, jenis susu, dan es) tanpa membuat tampilan pemesanan terasa mengintimidasi atau rumit layaknya formulir panjang.",theChallenge_en:"Coffee shop applications require a strong touch of personalization (such as adjusting cup sizes, sweetness, milk types, and ice) without making the ordering screen feel intimidating or cluttered like a long form.",theSolution:"Saya memecahkan masalah ini dengan pendekatan <em>card UI</em> dan <em>toggle buttons</em>. Pengguna dapat meracik kopi mereka melalui opsi visual yang menyenangkan secara interaktif. Skema warna yang digunakan didominasi oleh corak kopi elegan dan gaya minimalis yang mewah (<em>premium feel</em>).",theSolution_en:"I solved this problem using a card UI and toggle button approach. Users can customize their drinks interactively through pleasant visual choices. The color palette is dominated by elegant coffee shades and a luxurious minimalist styling for a premium feel.",keyFeatures:[{title:"Customization Interface",desc:"Antarmuka kustomisasi minuman (gula, es, susu) yang sangat mudah digunakan."},{title:"Premium Dark Theme",desc:"Skema warna elegan yang mencerminkan suasana kedai kopi berkelas."}],keyFeatures_en:[{title:"Customization Interface",desc:"Highly intuitive drink customization interface (sugar, ice, milk) with minimal steps."},{title:"Premium Dark Theme",desc:"An elegant color scheme reflecting the atmosphere of a classy coffee shop."}],theImpact:"Desain ini (yang juga dapat dilihat di portofolio Behance saya) merepresentasikan kapabilitas saya dalam memadukan keindahan visual estetis dengan pengalaman pengguna (<em>User Experience</em>) yang logis dan fungsional.",theImpact_en:"This design (which is also showcased on my Behance portfolio) represents my capability to blend aesthetic visual beauty with a logical, functional User Experience."},y="/assets/semesta-kecil-BX4zMtNq.webp",C={title:"Pameran Foto – Semesta Kecil",title_en:"Photography Exhibition – Semesta Kecil",slug:"pameran-foto-semesta-kecil",statusBadge:"Photography",statusBadge_en:"Photography",isActive:!1,roles:["Photographer","Exhibitor"],roles_en:["Photographer","Exhibitor"],description:"Karya fotografi bertema narasi kehidupan dan ruang pribadi yang dipamerkan dalam event fotografi Semesta Kecil tahun 2025.",description_en:"Photography work themed around life narratives and personal spaces exhibited in the 'Semesta Kecil' event in 2025.",imageSrc:y,techTags:["Photography","Event","Exhibition"],timeline:"2025",timeline_en:"2025",platform:"Exhibition / Physical",platform_en:"Exhibition / Physical",context:"Karya Pameran Fotografi",context_en:"Photography Exhibition Work",projectUrl:"https://www.instagram.com/diantaranya_/",theChallenge:"Bagaimana cara menangkap makna mendalam dari hal-hal yang sering diabaikan dalam keseharian? Tantangan utamanya adalah mengkomunikasikan cerita dan emosi melalui ruang pribadi dan objek-objek sederhana tanpa menggunakan narasi teks yang panjang.",theChallenge_en:"How to capture deep meaning from things often ignored in daily life? The main challenge was to communicate stories and emotions through personal spaces and simple objects without using long text narratives.",theSolution:"Melalui pendekatan fotografi dokumenter dan <em>fine art</em>, saya memfokuskan lensa pada detail-detail kecil—sudut ruangan, pencahayaan alami yang masuk dari jendela, hingga letak barang sehari-hari. Komposisi diatur sedemikian rupa untuk menciptakan kesan intim dan personal.",theSolution_en:"Through a documentary and fine art photography approach, I focused my lens on small details—room corners, natural light coming from windows, and the placement of daily items. The composition was arranged to create an intimate and personal impression.",keyFeatures:[{title:"Eksplorasi Visual",desc:"Pendekatan visual yang menitikberatkan pada pencahayaan dan tekstur benda sehari-hari."},{title:"Storytelling Tanpa Kata",desc:"Membangun narasi emosional hanya dengan komposisi gambar dan ruang."}],keyFeatures_en:[{title:"Visual Exploration",desc:"A visual approach focusing on lighting and the texture of everyday objects."},{title:"Wordless Storytelling",desc:"Building emotional narratives solely with image and space composition."}],theImpact:"Karya ini berhasil dipamerkan dalam event fotografi <strong>Semesta Kecil 2025</strong>. Pameran ini mengundang audiens untuk sejenak berhenti, merenung, dan melihat kembali keindahan serta kehangatan yang ada di sekitar mereka setiap harinya.",theImpact_en:"This work was successfully exhibited in the <strong>Semesta Kecil 2025</strong> photography event. The exhibition invited the audience to stop for a moment, reflect, and see the beauty and warmth surrounding them every day."},A="/assets/tanpa-batas-Ci9zTXql.webp",S={title:"Pameran Foto – Tanpa Batas",title_en:"Photography Exhibition – Tanpa Batas",slug:"pameran-foto-tanpa-batas",statusBadge:"Photography",statusBadge_en:"Photography",isActive:!1,roles:["Photographer","Exhibitor"],roles_en:["Photographer","Exhibitor"],description:"Karya fotografi bertema eksplorasi imajinasi yang dipamerkan dalam event fotografi Tanpa Batas tahun 2024.",description_en:"Photography work themed around exploring imagination exhibited in the 'Tanpa Batas' event in 2024.",imageSrc:A,techTags:["Photography","Event","Exhibition"],timeline:"2024",timeline_en:"2024",platform:"Exhibition / Physical",platform_en:"Exhibition / Physical",context:"Karya Pameran Fotografi",context_en:"Photography Exhibition Work",projectUrl:"https://www.instagram.com/diantaranya_/",theChallenge:"Menghadirkan karya seni visual yang tidak terikat oleh realitas. Tantangannya adalah menstimulasi audiens untuk berpikir di luar batas logika normal dan melihat kebebasan imajinasi murni melalui medium lensa kamera.",theChallenge_en:"Presenting visual artwork that is not bound by reality. The challenge was to stimulate the audience to think outside the limits of normal logic and witness pure imaginative freedom through the camera lens.",theSolution:"Saya bereksperimen dengan berbagai teknik komposisi tidak lazim, pencahayaan dramatis, dan permainan distorsi perspektif. Karya-karya ini dipilih secara kuratif untuk memberikan ruang bagi audiens dalam menginterpretasikan maknanya masing-masing, menciptakan diskusi dua arah antara karya dan penikmatnya.",theSolution_en:"I experimented with various unconventional composition techniques, dramatic lighting, and perspective distortion. These works were curatively selected to give the audience space to interpret their own meanings, creating a two-way discussion between the artwork and the viewer.",keyFeatures:[{title:"Konsep Surealisme",desc:"Pendekatan visual yang mencoba mendobrak batasan realitas fisik."},{title:"Interaksi Audiens",desc:"Karya yang secara khusus dirancang untuk memicu pertanyaan dan interpretasi bebas."}],keyFeatures_en:[{title:"Surrealist Concept",desc:"A visual approach attempting to break through the boundaries of physical reality."},{title:"Audience Interaction",desc:"Artwork specifically designed to trigger questions and open interpretations."}],theImpact:"Menjadi salah satu karya yang disorot dalam pameran <strong>Tanpa Batas 2024</strong>. Respons audiens sangat beragam, membuktikan bahwa fotografi mampu melampaui dokumentasi belaka dan menjadi alat ekspresi ideologi yang kuat.",theImpact_en:"Became one of the highlighted works in the <strong>Tanpa Batas 2024</strong> exhibition. Audience responses were diverse, proving that photography can transcend mere documentation and become a powerful tool for ideological expression."},f="/assets/rona-cPwmJ1u1.webp",w={title:"Pameran Diksar – Rona",title_en:"Diksar Exhibition – Rona",slug:"pameran-diksar-rona",statusBadge:"Photography",statusBadge_en:"Photography",isActive:!1,roles:["Photographer"],roles_en:["Photographer"],description:"Karya fotografi yang dipamerkan dalam pameran Rona sebagai bagian dari pendidikan dasar organisasi fotografi tahun 2023.",description_en:"Photography work displayed in the 'Rona' exhibition as part of a basic photography organization training in 2023.",imageSrc:f,techTags:["Photography","Event","Exhibition"],timeline:"2023",timeline_en:"2023",platform:"Exhibition / Physical",platform_en:"Exhibition / Physical",context:"Pendidikan Dasar Fotografi",context_en:"Basic Photography Training",projectUrl:"https://www.instagram.com/diantaranya_/",theChallenge:"Sebagai seorang pemula yang baru mendalami ilmu fotografi di tingkat pendidikan dasar organisasi, tantangan terbesarnya adalah menemukan ciri khas (<em>style</em>) dan keberanian berekspresi melalui komposisi warna, emosi, dan elemen pencahayaan.",theChallenge_en:"As a beginner newly diving into photography during the organization's basic education, the greatest challenge was finding a unique style and the courage to express it through color composition, emotion, and lighting elements.",theSolution:"Saya memfokuskan lensa pada permainan warna-warna kontras dan interaksi manusia dengan lingkungannya. Melalui proses kurasi yang ketat dan bimbingan mentor, foto ini terpilih karena dianggap berhasil menyampaikan cerita visual tanpa harus bergantung pada keterangan teks.",theSolution_en:"I focused my lens on contrasting colors and human interaction with their environment. Through a strict curation process and guidance from mentors, this photo was selected because it successfully conveyed a visual story without relying on text descriptions.",keyFeatures:[{title:"Komposisi Warna",desc:"Pemanfaatan kontras warna terang dan gelap untuk menonjolkan subjek."},{title:"Visual Storytelling",desc:"Menangkap momen sekilas (candid) yang bercerita."}],keyFeatures_en:[{title:"Color Composition",desc:"Utilization of contrast between bright and dark colors to highlight the subject."},{title:"Visual Storytelling",desc:"Capturing a candid, narrative-driven fleeting moment."}],theImpact:"Karya ini menjadi batu pijakan pertama saya di dunia fotografi formal. Dipamerkan di hadapan publik memberikan rasa percaya diri serta masukan berharga yang membentuk cara pandang estetika visual saya saat ini.",theImpact_en:"This work was my first stepping stone in formal photography. Being exhibited in front of the public gave me confidence as well as valuable feedback that shaped my current perspective on visual aesthetics."},P=[n,s,o,l,m,d,c,u,k,Z,C,S,w];export{P as a,t as b,e as c,g as d,r as f,i as n,a as v};
